        "obligations": [
          "Select exactly one verified Product basis through PRODUCT_BASIS before this workflow; source and basis integrity are not work authority.",
          "Resolve exact current owners and applicable accepted frame configuration. Preserve missing, ambiguous, stale and out-of-frame conditions; no mutable fallback.",
          "Acquire the task-bound frame and current workspace; discard private context without resetting actual progress. Material symbolic use follows the current interpretation but structural validation is not permission.",
          "Compute intake/classification from exact relevant public/authority/design facts; decide only residual meaning questions and keep failed candidates distinct from changes to governing outcome.",
          "Choose the owner carrier and admitted contract with exact authority, result surface and evidence. Reuse sufficient existing authorization; do not self-admit or automatically create tickets.",
          "Construct only in the causal cone and write territory. Direct Writer is allowed where sufficient; coordination and independence apply when required. Executive changes to a granted Writer before effects.",
          "Apply SPEC_METHOD transition-evidence-and-proof-cadence and its material owner dependencies for the exact bounded candidate; preserve failures, missing evidence, conditional proof and qualification gates, and return at the delegated boundary. Publication and adoption remain separate.",
          "Use Product Basis Selection Acquire A Member From The Selected Basis for every member/section route; the verified basis root is independent of plugin/current-directory layout.",
          "Select the responsibility route from the verified standards index and accepted frame basis: work/recovery, triage/carrier, constitutional derivation or relevant exact owners. Missing curated views permit only available exact owners on that same selected basis.",
